El zatona:-
===========
-Custom Command
	=>.claude/commands/command_name.md

-skills
	=>command to create: /plugin
	=>dir to save: .claude/skills/git-pushing
		=>scripts/smart_commit.sh
		=>SKILL.MD
-subagents
	=>command to create a new agent: /agents
	=>dir to save: .claude/agents/agent_name.md
	
	
-Rules(customizing context)
	=>memory/backend/CLAUD.MD
	=>bt5osh 3 el site dh ta5od el rule mno w t3mlha copy past hena f CLAUDE.MD file
	=>https://cursor.directory/rules/rails
	
	
-Plans
	=>lma bt3ml planning mn el ahsn t5lyh y7ot el plan de f folder esmo 
	=> dump the spec into a .md file
	=>memory/spec/CLAUDE.MD
