SKills vs MCP:- [DONE]
===============
-skills: 
	=> de haga sabta aw task mo3ena btktb fyha el instructions ll AI eno yt3lmha
	   w by3mlha b shakl consistent (daily).
	=> de btkon filles mwgoda f folder skills 
	=> el execution bykon f el 8alb locally.
	
-MCP:
	=> dh by5ly el AI bydwr f external resources 3n m3loma mo3ena.
	=> el execution bykon f el mcp servers.

-tb3n enta eli  bt7dd aw el agent hyst5dm meen w kda.
=============================================================================
skills vs subagents:- [DONE]
=====================
-subagents
	=> run on isolated and fresh context window w dh kois ll tasks el kbera w kda
	
-skills
	=> operate in the main agent window.

-tb a5tar men f eh? 
	=>lw 3andk heavy task w msh 3awz tfsh5 el main context window, est5dm subagent
